Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.87,0:00:03.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,内脏出血 很久很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a painful long time to bleed out from the gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 你想做什么就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do whatever you want, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆 他是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron … he's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,神的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the scribe of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是梅塔特隆 这是梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Metatron. This is Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们不是一类 我不是大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not one of them. I'm not an archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上帝选我记录神之语前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked in the secretarial pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个小秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}before god chose me to take down the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 第三项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it. The third trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么 - 治愈一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - To cure a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小卡 - 来帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass?! - A little help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿比顿 她是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon. She's a demon…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, it turns out, is a knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士是路西法亲手挑选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knights of hell are hand-picked by Lucifer himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑袋里的恶魔陷阱只是为了困住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon trap in your noggin is gonna keep you from smoking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把你碎尸万段\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna cut you into little steaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把尸块埋入水泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bury each strip under cement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:56.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科罗拉多 迷失溪）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你终于跟我来这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you finally came up here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会不来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真爱死这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得终于能呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like…I can breathe, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,咆哮声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The growl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.53,0:01:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 可能是只熊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Maybe it's a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢丽 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shelly, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, what is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.97,0:01:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是熊 是个食人魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a bear. It's a wendigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲进卧室里 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide in the bedroom. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来 谢丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide, Shelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米 我什么都没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy, I don't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.05,0:02:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他点着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna light his ugly ass on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's…h-happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.67,0:02:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你告诉我就这些了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please tell me that's everything. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 差得远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者记录了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, the men of letters kept files.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去三百年里的每一宗恶魔附身案例\N{\fnArial\fs30}on every demonic possession for the last 300 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:03:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,从利兹·鲍敦一直到伊卡博德·科雷恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we've got Borden, Lizzy, all the way to Crane, Ichabod.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.99,0:03:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整个身体都疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}my, uh, my whole body hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得又恶心又饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel nauseous and like I'm starving at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西都一股腐肉味\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything smells like rotting meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经历过这样的宿醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had that hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好受啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jager, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该休息一下 呼吸一下空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should, uh, take a break, get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 了结这事我才会觉得好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the only thing that's gonna make me feel better is finishing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去给你弄点吃的 让你有力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll go get you some grub, keep your strength up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很整洁有序\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's orderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等几个月再看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, give us a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩想买个乒乓球台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean wants to get a ping-pong table.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过 那是种游戏 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of that. It's a game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:04:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的伤势愈合得不够快\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wound isn't healing as quickly as I'd hoped…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却越来越糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了两项测试 还差一项\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, two trials down, one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的测试 你们知道是什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the final test, do you … you know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要治愈一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to cure a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也在查呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soup's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没变质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了一半的啤酒 牛肉干 三小杯花生酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A half-drunk beer, jerky, and three peanut-butter cups?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们补给不太够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're … we're running a little low.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去跑一趟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我可以跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 无视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, uh… like ignoring us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如带着天使石碑跑路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or like bolting off with the angel tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给弄丢了 就因为你不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}then losing it 'cause you didn't trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么说一句不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, that's not gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你带着你的抱歉去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can take your little apology and you cram it up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我以为那么做是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I thought I was doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个7B号房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, do we have a room 7b?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 别那么逼小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, go easy on Cass, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是好人这边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是任何别的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, if anybody else … I mean anybody …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,干那种混蛋事\N{\fnArial\fs30}pulled that kind of crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,原则上讲 我都要捅他们脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would stab them in their neck on principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:06:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么他就能无罪豁免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I give him a free pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to be looking for down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,找跟1138号案件相关的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, anything on case 1138.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是五级地狱事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a class 5 infernal event …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,1957年3月8日 圣路易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Louis, March 8, 1957.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.87,0:06:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,五级地狱事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Class 5 infernal event"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 记录者有一套评级标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. See, the letters have this whole rating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:23.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,《驱魔人》里面描述的也就二级\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The exorcist" would have been a class 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这次为什么那么特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what makes this puppet show so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一卷案宗的空白处写着7B号房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the files just had a note written in the margin about room 7b.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和「奇怪」两个字 后面是三个惊叹号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the word "weird" with three exclamation points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.09,0:06:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是恶魔陷阱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a devil's trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,占了半个房间啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes up half the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些锁链 上面刻着咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}These chains … they have spellwork etched into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个地牢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Movie night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙 开始拍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon, we're filming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界 你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hello, world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看到的这种新仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this new ritual we're going to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的驱魔仪式 是怎么进行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this new type of exorcism, h-how does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我也是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个不是阿比顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, is that Abbadon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么大杀气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not killy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是被她附身的那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be the, uh, the chick she possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们得开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry. We must do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了 他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead! They're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone you ever loved…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些锁链跟我们地牢里的一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, those chains look exactly like the ones in our dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拴住的恶魔 酷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon on a leash … cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop filming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:09:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你停下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you just stop?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是挺怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was weird…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,加三个惊叹号\N{\fnArial\fs30}With three exclamation points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是一般的驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't a normal exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们改了词\N{\fnArial\fs30}They changed the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Lustr」应该是拉丁语中的洗刷或清洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe "Lustr" is latin for wash or cleanse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 最奇怪的是他们的用词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, 'cause that was the most freaky thing was the vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那血手和胸口爆裂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the bloody high five or the chest burster?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,片子上还有别的吗 比如导演评论音轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else on the film, like director's commentary,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,续集呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sequel, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,年老的那个牧师 麦克斯·汤普森\N{\fnArial\fs30}The older priest, Max Thompson,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,58年死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}bit the dust in '58,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但年轻的那个还活着 还住在圣路易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the younger one is still alive and still lives in st. Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这个怪事值得我们去一趟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think this kind of weird is worth the drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 那些卷宗里的每一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, everything in those folders …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,附身 恶魔交易 等等一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}the possessions, the deals, all of it …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都见过了 但那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've seen that before, but that …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是全新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was all new.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然值得我们去一趟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's worth the drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的伤势比我重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is more damaged than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可就算他受伤了 萨姆也挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you know, even banged up, Sammy comes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 我只想帮忙 - 我们不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, I just want to help. - We don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这儿 养好身体吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay here and … and get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤普森神父有一些新奇的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Thompson had some unorthodox ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以记录者才会感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why the men of letters were interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么新奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unorthodox how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为恶魔可以被拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believed demons could be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「拯救」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly do you mean, "saved"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔是人的灵魂 在地狱里被扭曲玷污了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon is a human soul, twisted and corrupted by its time in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤普森神父认为 你可以洗净那些污秽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Thompson believed that you could wash that taint away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复他们的人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}and restore their humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他们就继续留在他们附身的人身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, they just stay in whatever schmuck they're possessing and … and.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就能升天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}get a ticket upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but this … this ritual…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,能治愈恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}can cure a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果起效的话 或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose, if it worked,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那晚 出了很大的岔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that night, something went terribly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个恶魔逃窜了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon escaped into the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那个可怜的老妇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that poor old woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道汤普森神父没有放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know father Thompson kept trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他附身事件 他继续了试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were other possessions, experiments,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那之后我无法再那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't face that … not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 几个月后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, a few months later…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么把他撕裂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tore him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he keep any, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做了记录或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}did he keep records or …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这儿有洗手间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh do you have a-a bathroom, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟没事差得远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…pretty damn far from all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是为这个而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.26,0:13:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,简而言之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, short story is, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆会把撕碎你朋友的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy there is gonna take whatever shredded your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.99,0:13:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他所有的黑眼混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every other black-eyed bitch out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统了结掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's gonna get rid of them for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父 过去几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, over the past couple of months,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我目睹他做了很多我以为不可能的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen him do crap that I didn't even think was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, sure, he's miserable and he's hurting,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丝毫不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a doubt in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会走到终点 一点不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he's gonna cross that finish line … not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去给你拿汤普森神父的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get father Thompson's things for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲究点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,馅饼在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个处男放下 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the virgin down, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大名鼎鼎的梅塔特隆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,公共场合喊我马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}In public, it's Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文·谭跟我说你的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin Tran told me about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He did? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.02,0:15:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,据他说 我们有很多共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to him, you and I have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是思想自由的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both free thinkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都被天堂通缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both on heaven's most wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们该联络一下感情 一起吃个饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we could socialize, maybe grab a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们…什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry … we can…what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在「休假」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've been on sabbatical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了解最新的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to play catch-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得找个人谈谈老家的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have to talk to somebody about what's going on back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老家是指天堂 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And by home, you mean heaven? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到处逛了逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking around,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:16:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬进了几个天使的脑子里瞧了瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}crawling through a few divine nooks and crannies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.39,0:16:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我看到的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and from what I can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大天使一走 上面一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the archangels, it's a mess up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,处于混战之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 娜奥米在管理天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Naomi was running things now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是这么说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what she told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜奥米的确参与了竞争 但她不是唯一的选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Naomi's a player … don't get me wrong … just one of many.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,派系多不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are factions upon factions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在互相打斗 背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}all fighting, betraying each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们早晚会把彼此都撕烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a matter of time before they start ripping each other apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.23,0:16:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 那是我造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm the one who broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾以为我能领导我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time when I thought I could lead our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我造成了无数死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spilled so much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着为自己的行为赎罪 我苦修\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've tried to atone for my sins and I did penance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.16,0:16:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护我们的秘密而背叛朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I betrayed my friends to protect our secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've just failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在 天使 天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now the angels … heaven …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要有人去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}need someone to come to the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们 - 对 想象一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Us? - Yeah. Just … just picture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去拯救他们 挽救大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ride to the rescue, save the day …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说起来多好听啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使就像一个庞大的有问题的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the angels are like a big, dysfunctional family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把他们都锁在一个屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to lock them all in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到把这些问题都解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we work these problems out …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的派系 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the factions, you, me …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,像一场巨大的家庭集会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like a big family meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得关闭天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we have to shut down heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢可丽饼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like crepes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥海的尤金妮做的苹果可丽饼最好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugenie's in Ojai makes the greatest caramel apple crepes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆 马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron … Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he blew town?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.66,0:17:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it turns out that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:18:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤普森神父把恶魔治愈的测试都做了记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}father Thompson recorded all of his demon-cure tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one here, this was the last one …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天后他就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是1958年8月3日\N{\fnArial\fs30}The date is August 3, 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第19次试验 第一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is trial 19, hour 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验对象 彼得·肯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My subject is Peter Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯特先生是两个幼子的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kent is the father of two young sons,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周之前 他被一个恶魔附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and three weeks ago, he was possessed by a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要问你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to ask you a question now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你钻进肯特先生的身体 吃掉他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you crawled into Mr. Kent and ate his children,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orgasmic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经注入第一剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first dose has been administered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道牧师给头号爸爸注射的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we know what padre was dosing number-one dad up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己净化的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, his own purified blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.49,0:19:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么净化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purified how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he started,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤普森神父去忏悔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Thompson went to confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是19号审判 第二小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is trial 19, hour 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃他的孩子时 是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you ate his children, how did it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有嚼头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stringy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经注入第二剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second dose has been administered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hour 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃他的孩子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you ate his children …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃屎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么感觉 - 软软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did it feel? - Soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经注入第六剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sixth dose has been administered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是… - 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How… - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…did it…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.17,0:19:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,第八小时 实验对象已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hour 8, the subject is prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃他的孩子时 是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you ate his children, how did it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were screaming…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did I laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.51,0:20:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 我是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在又变回了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you are a man again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被拯救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have been saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.25,0:21:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚刚…治愈了一个恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he just… cure a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们能测试一下这个方法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we take this hoodoo on a test drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱魔法就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I mean, I have the exorcism right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要血液 圣地 和一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need is the blood, consecrated ground, and a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做 召唤一个恶魔 然后困住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? We summon a demon, trap it …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.45,0:21:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们用我们已经抓到的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or … or we use one that we've already tagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的战地外科医生手术包还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we still have dad's old army field surgeon's kit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在行李箱里 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the trunk. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.43,0:21:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该把那个讨厌鬼拼起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think it's time we put Humpty Dumpty back together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿着肚子可不能谈这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have this conversation on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,您要点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.53,0:21:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 外套很酷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Cool coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 其实很保暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's actually quite warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱又幽默 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute and funny … okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道我就选个帅点的皮囊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have picked a better-looking vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说关闭天堂是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you mean, we can shut down heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 那些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know, the trials …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.62,0:22:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝设下的紧急情况按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's little "Pull in case of emergency",
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.19,0:22:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果利维坦逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Leviathans get out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把它们扔回炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}you put them in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.04,0:22:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果恶魔们玩得太过火了 扔回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons get a little too demonic, toss 'em into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.63,0:22:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们过于膨胀了 关上天国之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels get uppity, slam the pearly gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.91,0:22:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你知道关闭天堂的测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying you know the trials to close heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我记下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.06,0:22:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事情你可忘不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not something you forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 单独待会儿对天使来说不是坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I think a little alone time would be good for the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少能够…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the very least, it would s…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够避免让上面的争斗祸及下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would stop the fighting up there from spilling out down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.64,0:22:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那是必然结果 一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will happen. It always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要完成这些测试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna complete these tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:22:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.21,0:22:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.77,0:23:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个秘书 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a pencil pusher, always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.25,0:23:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不够强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你呢 你是个斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you … you are a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.99,0:23:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来付诸实践\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.61,0:23:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们合力 必能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.65,0:23:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂需要你的帮助 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven needs your help, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罪魁祸首\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the one that caused these problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实该我来收拾这个烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be the one to fix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.97,0:23:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须知道 这事可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you understand this is, um, not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.91,0:23:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.81,0:23:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见那个女招待了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See our waitress?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.63,0:23:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是第一道测试 把她的心挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the first trial … got to cut her heart out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.35,0:23:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.09,0:23:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.38,0:23:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个拿非利人 禁忌之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a Nephilim, an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是天使和凡人的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the offspring of an angel and a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.06,0:23:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不是禁止的吗 - 是禁止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought that wasn't allowed. - It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.78,0:24:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上仅此一个 就是她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one on earth, and you are looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.56,0:24:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她并没选择做一个拿非利人 她是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she didn't choose to be a nephilim, so she's innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.16,0:24:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你了 这事不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it wasn't gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想完成这个 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to do this, Castiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.09,0:24:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真心想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you really want to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.68,0:24:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得问问自己什么才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got to ask yourself what's more important …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她的生命还是你的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her life or your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.41,0:24:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这样能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you really think this will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.67,0:24:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 我们有了针线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we got needles. We got thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.14,0:24:35.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,《年轻的科学怪人》我们都看过几千次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen "Young Frankenstein" about a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're golden.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.81,0:24:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很恶心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.69,0:25:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊 帅哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sunshines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.05,0:25:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.11,0:25:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你们二位好多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I owe you both so, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.70,0:25:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真等不及要扯下你们漂亮的绿眼睛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to tear out those pretty green eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.10,0:25:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们觉得你用不上爪子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We figured kitty didn't need her claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.89,0:25:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就把你们踩死 那也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll stump you to death. It'll be swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.69,0:25:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你也别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's not gonna happen, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.29,0:25:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得那颗子弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet … remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像个小贱人那样坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you sit there like a good little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.73,0:25:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把这块地圣化\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna consecrate the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.27,0:26:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要老实坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna get to fessing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.63,0:26:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这话耳熟啊 - 我看未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I know this tune. - I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.19,0:26:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯·汤普森神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Max Thompson,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.15,0:26:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,1910年10月12日生\N{\fnArial\fs30}born October 12, 1910.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.40,0:26:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,死于1958年8月5日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died August 5, 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.07,0:26:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是谁把他撕碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think ripped him apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.20,0:26:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大本营那里听说了麦克斯干的捣乱事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word got back to home office that Maxie was messing with things,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.51,0:26:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我们杀一儆百\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we made an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.01,0:26:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不是我最有美感的一次杀戮 但很有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my most artful kill, but it was effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.19,0:26:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外惊喜是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bonus …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.55,0:26:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死前跟我说了乔茜·桑兹的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he died, he told me all about Josie Sands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.54,0:26:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了她 借她的身体找到了记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found her, and I rode her into the men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.45,0:26:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他们做的事 那才叫艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I did to them, that was art.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.92,0:26:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你知道麦克斯在做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know what Max was doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.91,0:26:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了个大致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fella screamed the basics…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.85,0:26:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.14,0:26:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就那么安慰自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.55,0:26:48.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（666魔鬼来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.39,0:26:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 孩儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.27,0:26:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.57,0:26:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.34,0:26:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个推销员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The salesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.57,0:27:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.52,0:27:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开我心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.60,0:27:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.82,0:27:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.93,0:27:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么拿到这个号码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.81,0:27:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要紧事先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, first things first …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.20,0:27:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿着什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.26,0:27:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 给我挂了 马上挂掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, hanging up now. Hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不是打来闲聊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. This isn't a social call.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.42,0:27:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.87,0:27:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最近读报纸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lads been reading the papers,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:33.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,比如昨天的《丹佛时报》\N{\fnArial\fs30}say, Denver Times from yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.45,0:27:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.66,0:27:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该看看 令人震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you should. It's side-splitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:28:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了 我把地址发给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell … I'm sexting you an address.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.94,0:28:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.29,0:28:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头再聊 拜拜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll talk. Cheerio.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.44,0:28:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.02,0:28:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿呢 死者名叫汤米·科林斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is. Vic's name is Tommy Collins.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.60,0:28:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米 怎么这么耳熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy. Why do I know that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.28,0:28:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米·科林斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Tommy Collins,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.19,0:28:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好久以前从食人魔手里把他救了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we saved him from a wendigo like forever ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.38,0:28:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 克劳力把他的头炸下来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and, what, you think that Crowley blew his head off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.20,0:28:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are we dealing with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.08,0:28:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔和食人魔联手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of demon-wendigo team-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.64,0:28:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.35,0:28:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回头再纪念汤米吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, we'll pour one out for Tommy later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.49,0:29:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于克劳力 去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as Crowley goes, screw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.38,0:29:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们具备了一切让他永远休息的条件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got everything we need to put him in a permanent time-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.01,0:29:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.98,0:29:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's … son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.48,0:29:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.17,0:29:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.72,0:29:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克劳力来的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a text message from Crowley …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.00,0:29:39.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（印第安纳州 兴隆市 绿叶街545号 306室）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.53,0:29:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是印第安纳州 兴隆市的一个地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}An address in Prosperity, Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.09,0:29:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,兴隆市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prosperity?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.71,0:29:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那儿接过一桩案子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't we work a case there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.09,0:29:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是女巫和烘培食品那桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, the one with the witches and the baked goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 他又去找那里什么人的麻烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? He's going after somebody there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.34,0:29:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.97,0:29:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道是陷阱 - 当然是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you know it's a trap. - Of course it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.17,0:29:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是陷阱意味着有恶魔 我们现在需要一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a trap means demons, and we could use one right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.71,0:30:03.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（印第安纳州 兴隆市）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.47,0:30:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.02,0:30:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是詹妮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that…Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.57,0:30:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好女孩 詹妮·克莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a great gal, Jenny Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.68,0:31:04.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（666魔鬼来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.71,0:31:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 你到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.15,0:31:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鹿 这还不明显吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, moosie, isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.13,0:31:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在杀你们救过的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm killing everyone you've ever saved …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.23,0:31:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,困境中的少女 无辜的傲慢者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damsels in distress, the innocent whippersnappers,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.71,0:31:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,险些被吸血鬼吃掉的人 他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The would-be vampire chow … all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.82,0:31:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you even know …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.83,0:31:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有线人和强大的研究小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my sources and a cracking research team.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.12,0:31:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩到一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you boys hit a town,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.69,0:31:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常会搞得人仰马翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tend to leave a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.91,0:31:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大概在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're probably wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下怎么没有留在那里赶你们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}why my droogs aren't in there giving you the bum's rush,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.75,0:31:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就开门见山地说吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's brass these tacks, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.07,0:31:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,每12小时 我就要把一个人开肠破肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna gut one person every 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.06,0:31:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你们俩把恶魔石碑给我送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you bring me the demon tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.00,0:31:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且终止这个荒谬的测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stop this whole trials nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.82,0:31:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有石碑 凯文拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have the tablet. Kevin took it and …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住了凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.44,0:31:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有人又救走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then someone took him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.24,0:31:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,云端传话下来 说不是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word from the cloud is that it wasn't heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.06,0:32:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以世界上最聪明伶俐的小先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either the cutest little prophet in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.39,0:32:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么和你们俩在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}is with you two lads,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.43,0:32:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么你们最好赶紧找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you better find him tout-bloody-suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.76,0:32:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为时间在飞逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}because time, she is a-wasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.73,0:32:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们在想办法阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}About now, you're thinking of ways to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.72,0:32:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be able to,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.34,0:32:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们还是会尝试 因为你们就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'll try because that's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.96,0:32:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.93,0:32:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该进行实例教学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, time for an object lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.03,0:32:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳波利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indianapolis,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾薇旅馆 116房\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Ivy motel, room 116.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.60,0:32:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还有57分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 57 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.40,0:32:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.72,0:33:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.15,0:33:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莎拉·布莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sarah Blake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.72,0:33:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.26,0:33:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.87,0:33:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.91,0:33:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到你们的光环\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see your halos.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.70,0:33:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你是什么 禁忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we know what you are, abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.02,0:33:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.87,0:33:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量友善待人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.46,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想过自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to live my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.37,0:33:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.96,0:33:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.35,0:34:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩得开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.68,0:34:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要禁忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want an abomination?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.54,0:34:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你见识一下禁忌的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个名叫克劳力的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a demon named Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.23,0:34:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要在16分钟后杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna kill me in…16 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.26,0:34:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.14,0:34:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.03,0:35:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.84,0:35:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在印第安纳波利斯干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing in Indy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.79,0:35:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在帮我爸爸物色房产买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…was scouting an estate sale for my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.71,0:35:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在这里布满恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're gonna put devil's traps everywhere …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.75,0:35:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗户 门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The windows, the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.37,0:35:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got holy water,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.81,0:35:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,循环播放的驱魔咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}an exorcism ready to play on a loop,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.61,0:35:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过那扇门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and anything that comes through that door …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.26,0:35:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会变成肉泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.75,0:35:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know this is insane,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.05,0:35:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们常常这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but insane is kind of what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.40,0:35:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.88,0:35:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.54,0:35:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.09,0:35:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前也这么做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.55,0:36:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个以前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.96,0:36:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.14,0:36:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Ian.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.28,0:36:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是搜索与营救队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He works search and rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.19,0:36:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我喜欢这个类型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I have a type.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.76,0:36:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的女儿 贝丝 再有一个月就满周岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our daughter, Bess … she'll be one in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.89,0:36:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.27,0:36:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.90,0:36:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.90,0:36:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为你高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.10,0:36:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.29,0:36:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎没什么变化吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much the same, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.99,0:36:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.37,0:36:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.87,0:37:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's been years,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.34,0:37:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都无法想象你都经历了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't even imagine the things you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.45,0:37:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.35,0:37:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.88,0:37:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,更专注 更自信 好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}…more focused, confident, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.63,0:37:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像知道自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like you know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.15,0:37:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成熟了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grew up, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.59,0:37:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是喜欢你以前的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do miss the old haircut, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.16,0:37:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.75,0:37:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.32,0:37:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.82,0:37:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trios…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.39,0:37:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zwei…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.78,0:37:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}…uno.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.05,0:37:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.09,0:37:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你能听见我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.19,0:38:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.37,0:38:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要死了 你们什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dying, and there's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.31,0:38:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个婊子养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.29,0:38:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是女巫养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a witch, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.86,0:38:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈咪教会了我一些招数\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mommy taught me a few tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.78,0:38:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是咒语 快找魔法袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a spell. Find the hex bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.16,0:38:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑过派几个大块头去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought of sending in a few of my bruisers,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.92,0:38:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们好好玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}really letting them go to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.24,0:38:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是呢 测试一杀死了一只地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, well, trial one was kill a hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试二是从地狱拯救一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trial two was rescue a soul from the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.62,0:38:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此往后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, from here on,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.41,0:38:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让一切和地狱有关的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep everything hell-related …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.00,0:38:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔等等的 离你们远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons, et cetera … away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.82,0:38:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是出于安全考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe side and all that …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.41,0:38:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 我觉得这样很合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I just thought it seemed fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.39,0:38:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我了解 小萨姆让那小妞无法呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I understand, Sammy took that bird's breath away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.89,0:38:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.30,0:38:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救他人 猎杀凶鬼恶灵 家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things … the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.06,0:38:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们救下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think the people you save,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.69,0:38:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们用他们来证明你们可悲的人生有些用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're how you justify your pathetic little lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.28,0:39:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,酗酒 附带伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alcoholism, the collateral damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.51,0:39:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所造成的一切痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pain you've caused …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.97,0:39:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一件能让你们每夜安睡的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one thing that allows you to sleep at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.48,0:39:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一件就是知道这些人们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one thing is knowing that these folks are out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.96,0:39:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们 他们还快乐健康地活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}still out there happy and healthy because of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.76,0:39:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这两个伟大的该死的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}you great, big, bloody heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.82,0:39:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Hey! You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.59,0:39:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 - 他们是你们毕生的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah? - They're your life's work,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.80,0:39:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这一切一点一点撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going to rip it apart piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.27,0:39:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们无法阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you can't stop me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还因为 当他们都死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and because when they're all gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.83,0:39:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还剩下什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what will you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.00,0:39:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.70,0:39:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.97,0:39:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.37,0:39:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想让那些人继续活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to keep those people alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.02,0:39:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要完全彻底的投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want complete and utter surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.21,0:39:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,石碑 测试 全部都放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tablet, the Trials … you'll give them up,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们就继续这么玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we'll keep doing this dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.46,0:40:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们选择吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your choice, my darlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.81,0:40:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.62,0:40:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在情况很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know it's bad right now, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.66,0:40:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们还是得按计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.71,0:40:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shut down hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.06,0:40:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.11,0:40:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get a demon …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.86,0:40:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到克劳力的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.84,0:40:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会让任何恶魔接近我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna let one near us,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.89,0:41:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有恶魔 我们只能傻坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and without a demon, all we can do is sit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.87,0:41:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着所有我们认识的人 我们救下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watch people we know, people we saved,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.34,0:41:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,像莎拉一样死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}die like Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.15,0:41:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.71,0:41:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.91,0:41:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这场争斗我们赢不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this isn't one we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.10,0:41:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们就该接受条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should just take the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.07,0:41:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.64,0:41:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.62,0:41:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we'll get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.57,0:41:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会像以往一样打个漂亮仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll kick it in the ass like we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.91,0:41:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和我一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me?
